MangOn includes a Persian-only adaptation of the GlobalComix Mihon extension from:
https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source

Upstream snapshot: ee661f5233b346559fbdd53993d447c318c5aef0
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt).

Adaptations in src/fa/globalcomix:
- Restricts the extension registration to Persian (fa).
- Validates GlobalComix manga URLs as HTTPS and on the expected host/path.
- Returns no reader pages for premium chapters, missing page payloads, or individual paid pages.
- Filters image URLs to HTTPS.

The original Keiyoushi source and its DTO structure remain attributed to their upstream project.
